{
  "label": "Review",
  "description": "Layer-by-layer: does what was built match what THAT layer said it would be (feature.md §8). Findings plus corrections, no new doc. The two lenses are independent find passes and run concurrently; merge parks until both have landed. The verdict is acted on by the root, whose review mount routes a revise to failing_layer.",
